# Single source of truth for the Solana e2e kms-core image tag (FI#1546).
#
# Consumed by both shell (solana/scripts/e2e/clean-e2e.sh sources this file) and TS
# (demo/lifecycle.ts reads it) so the tag cannot drift across call sites.
#
# CORE_VERSION is the kms-core server built from https://github.com/zama-ai/kms/pull/934 at
# 177a2302, the same commit the vendored TKMS WASM client and the connector's kms-grpc pin are
# built from (one artifact set, see sdk/js-sdk/src/wasm/tkms/KMS_BUILT_FROM). kms CI built the
# image from its merge into kms main (revision 4ffd76b1), which has the same tree. Every fhevm-built component
# (connector, relayer, coprocessor, contracts) runs from this tree: solana-e2e.yml builds it or
# pulls the branch-published `feature-solana-<sha>` image (select-overrides.sh), and clean-e2e.sh
# builds it via --override. Nothing pins those to a tag here.
CORE_VERSION=177a230
